      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The shift to an automated economy is fundamentally a product of relentless technological advancement, making it an inevitable force of social evolution. However, how society *manages* that transition—whether it leads to widespread prosperity or mass inequality—is absolutely a policy choice. Governments must proactively implement policies like universal basic income or massive retraining programs to steer this inevitable technological tide toward a beneficial outcome for all citizens.",
